### Existing Behavior To Preserve

- The 500ms visual LED state machine and the 100-300-100ms buzzer timing must remain perfectly intact.
- The duty cycles of the Left Turn Signal LEDs (which reside on `FLEXPWM0_SM0_A` and `kPWM_PwmX`) must not be glitched or broken when `FLEXPWM0_SM0` changes its frequency.
